config AM335X_TIMER
	bool "TI AM335x DMTimer driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_TI_AM335X_TIMER_ENABLED
	select TICKLESS_CAPABLE
	help
	  Enable DMTimer driver for TI AM335x SoC series.
	  This driver provides:
	  - System clock source
	  - Tickless kernel support
	  - 32-bit counter
	  - Match and overflow interrupts
	  - Up to 8 timer modules (DMTIMER0-7)